---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy Policy | Foam War Parties" description="How Foam War Parties collects, uses and protects your information." active={null}>
<section style="position:relative;background:#182B49;color:#fff;padding:20px 0 36px;overflow:hidden;min-height:300px;display:flex;align-items:center"><img src="/images/foam-lineart.png" alt="" style="position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:center;filter:invert(1);mix-blend-mode:screen;opacity:.13">
<div style="position:absolute;inset:0;background:radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 55% at 50% 38%,rgba(14,26,46,.92) 0%,rgba(14,26,46,.6) 55%,rgba(14,26,46,0) 100%)">
</div>
<div style="position:relative;max-width:1200px;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;margin:0 auto;padding:0 var(--padx);width:100%;text-align:center">
<h1 style="font-family:'Archivo Black',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(40px,7vw,64px);line-height:1;margin:0;text-transform:uppercase;text-shadow:0 3px 6px rgba(10,20,38,.6)">Privacy <span style="color:#FF7518;text-shadow:0 0 6px rgba(255,117,24,.28),0 0 12px rgba(255,117,24,.16)">Policy</span></h1>
</div>
</section>
<section style="background:#fff;color:#182B49;padding:72px 0">
<div style="max-width:1200px;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;margin:0 auto;padding:0 var(--padx)">
<div style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:40px">
<div style="display:inline-block;background:#0875D1;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;letter-spacing:.04em;padding:8px 16px;border-radius:999px;text-transform:uppercase">Last updated: November 18, 2026</div>
</div>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,380px),1fr));gap:24px;align-items:stretch">
<div style="background:#F3F4F6;border-radius:28px;padding:28px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px">
<div style="width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:50%;background:#0875D1;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:'Archivo Black',sans-serif;font-size:22px">1</div>
<h3 style="font-family:'Archivo Black',sans-serif;font-size:22px;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0;color:#182B49">Who We Are</h3>
<p style="margin:0;font-size:18px;line-height:1.55;text-wrap:pretty">Foam War Parties (FoamBattleParties LLC), based in Forsyth, Missouri. Contact: <a href="tel:+14175592347" style="color:#0875D1;font-weight:800;text-decoration:none">(417) 559-2347</a> · <a href="mailto:joshuaenglish72@gmail.com" style="color:#0875D1;font-weight:800;text-decoration:none">joshuaenglish72@gmail.com</a></p>
</div>
<div style="background:#F3F4F6;border-radius:28px;padding:28px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px">
<div style="width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:50%;background:#FF7518;color:#182B49;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:'Archivo Black',sans-serif;font-size:22px">2</div>
<h3 style="font-family:'Archivo Black',sans-serif;font-size:22px;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0;color:#182B49">Information We Collect</h3>
<p style="margin:0;font-size:18px;line-height:1.55;text-wrap:pretty">Name, phone number, email, event address, event date and details, and payment information you provide when booking or contacting us.</p>
</div>
<div style="background:#F3F4F6;border-radius:28px;padding:28px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px">
<div style="width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:50%;background:#0875D1;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:'Archivo Black',sans-serif;font-size:22px">3</div>
<h3 style="font-family:'Archivo Black',sans-serif;font-size:22px;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0;color:#182B49">How We Use Your Information</h3>
<p style="margin:0;font-size:18px;line-height:1.55;text-wrap:pretty">To respond to inquiries, schedule and deliver your party or rental, process payments, send booking confirmations and reminders, and improve our services.</p>
</div>
<div style="background:#F3F4F6;border-radius:28px;padding:28px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px">
<div style="width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:50%;background:#FF7518;color:#182B49;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:'Archivo Black',sans-serif;font-size:22px">4</div>
<h3 style="font-family:'Archivo Black',sans-serif;font-size:22px;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0;color:#182B49">Payments</h3>
<p style="margin:0;font-size:18px;line-height:1.55;text-wrap:pretty">Payments are processed securely by our third-party payment processor (Stripe). We do not store your full card details.</p>
</div>
<div style="background:#F3F4F6;border-radius:28px;padding:28px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px">
<div style="width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:50%;background:#0875D1;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:'Archivo Black',sans-serif;font-size:22px">5</div>
<h3 style="font-family:'Archivo Black',sans-serif;font-size:22px;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0;color:#182B49">Text Messages</h3>
<p style="margin:0;font-size:18px;line-height:1.55;text-wrap:pretty">If you contact us by text or provide your phone number, we may text you about your booking. Message and data rates may apply. Reply STOP to opt out.</p>
</div>
<div style="background:#F3F4F6;border-radius:28px;padding:28px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px">
<div style="width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:50%;background:#FF7518;color:#182B49;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:'Archivo Black',sans-serif;font-size:22px">6</div>
<h3 style="font-family:'Archivo Black',sans-serif;font-size:22px;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0;color:#182B49">Cookies & Analytics</h3>
<p style="margin:0;font-size:18px;line-height:1.55;text-wrap:pretty">We use cookies and analytics tools (such as Google Analytics) to understand how visitors use our website.</p>
</div>
<div style="background:#F3F4F6;border-radius:28px;padding:28px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px">
<div style="width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:50%;background:#0875D1;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:'Archivo Black',sans-serif;font-size:22px">7</div>
<h3 style="font-family:'Archivo Black',sans-serif;font-size:22px;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0;color:#182B49">Sharing Your Information</h3>
<p style="margin:0;font-size:18px;line-height:1.55;text-wrap:pretty">We do not sell your personal information. We only share it with service providers who help us run our business (such as payment processing and scheduling) or when required by law.</p>
</div>
<div style="background:#F3F4F6;border-radius:28px;padding:28px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px">
<div style="width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:50%;background:#FF7518;color:#182B49;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:'Archivo Black',sans-serif;font-size:22px">8</div>
<h3 style="font-family:'Archivo Black',sans-serif;font-size:22px;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0;color:#182B49">Data Security</h3>
<p style="margin:0;font-size:18px;line-height:1.55;text-wrap:pretty">We take reasonable steps to protect your information.</p>
</div>
<div style="background:#F3F4F6;border-radius:28px;padding:28px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px">
<div style="width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:50%;background:#0875D1;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:'Archivo Black',sans-serif;font-size:22px">9</div>
<h3 style="font-family:'Archivo Black',sans-serif;font-size:22px;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0;color:#182B49">Children's Privacy</h3>
<p style="margin:0;font-size:18px;line-height:1.55;text-wrap:pretty">Our website is intended for adults booking on behalf of their families or groups. We do not knowingly collect information from children under 13.</p>
</div>
<div style="background:#F3F4F6;border-radius:28px;padding:28px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px">
<div style="width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:50%;background:#FF7518;color:#182B49;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:'Archivo Black',sans-serif;font-size:22px">10</div>
<h3 style="font-family:'Archivo Black',sans-serif;font-size:22px;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0;color:#182B49">Changes to This Policy</h3>
<p style="margin:0;font-size:18px;line-height:1.55;text-wrap:pretty">We may update this policy from time to time. Updates will be posted on this page.</p>
</div>
<div style="background:#F3F4F6;border-radius:28px;padding:28px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px">
<div style="width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:50%;background:#0875D1;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:'Archivo Black',sans-serif;font-size:22px">11</div>
<h3 style="font-family:'Archivo Black',sans-serif;font-size:22px;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0;color:#182B49">Contact Us</h3>
<p style="margin:0;font-size:18px;line-height:1.55;text-wrap:pretty">Questions? Call or text <a href="tel:+14175592347" style="color:#0875D1;font-weight:800;text-decoration:none">(417) 559-2347</a>.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
</Base>
